        <p>This application requires a Google Gemini API key to function. Your key is stored securely in your browser's local storage and is never sent to our servers.</p>
        <div className="billing-notice" style={{ backgroundColor: 'rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.1)', padding: '1rem', borderLeft: '4px solid var(--status-amber)', margin: '1rem 0', borderRadius: '4px' }}>
            <p style={{ margin: 0, fontSize: '0.9rem' }}>
                <strong>Important:</strong> To use high-performance models (like Gemini 3 Pro), you must select an API key from a paid GCP project. Review the <a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/billing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style={{ color: 'var(--accent-color)' }}>billing documentation</a> for details.
            </p>
